BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Open Gate Day at Bradford Woods
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T140000
UID:7d24cef752e1ba9e88888bece8a37792@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Stop by between 10 am and 2 pm for a fun day in the outdoors w
 ith free fishing\, ziplining\, rope climbing\, archery\, and hiking! Pack 
 a picnic and enjoy lunch on the property\, too. Here are a few important d
 etails: Ziplining and climbing participants must weigh at least 50 lbs. An
 yone age 18 or older who plans to fish must have a valid Indiana fishing l
 icense. Please bring your own bait and tackle. Fishing is land-based only.
LOCATION:Bradford Woods\, 5040 State Road 67 North\, Martinsville
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/open-gate-day-at-bradford-woods/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
