BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Saturday Crafternoons at the Wylie House Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T140000
UID:1efc0924330ee8a20fa69d0105a36cfc@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that Ginkgo trees lose all their leaves at once? 
 We invite you to join us in collecting and preserving Bloomington’s fall
  colors by dipping them in wax as we count down the days until our ginkgo 
 trees drop all their leaves! You’ll also learn more about the Wylie Hous
 e Museum’s arbor history and unique trees on our property! Check the Wyl
 ie House Museum socials and website for updated information\, parking info
 rmation\, and museum tour hours.
LOCATION:Wylie House Museum\, 307 E. 2nd St.\,  Bloomington\,  IN
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/saturday-crafternoons-at-the-wylie-house-museu
 m/
