BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Zentangle Time
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T150000
UID:ee7cdb9850f1aa482933681f61213934@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Registration required. Registration is for all 6 sessions (one
  per month November – April). Come learn and explore the art of Zentangl
 e®. Learn a variety of tangle patterns in this easy\, meditative art form
  that anyone can do! Each participant will receive a Zentangle® spinner b
 lank. Learn 3 tangles per session to build out your spinner. At the end of
  the session you will have drawn 18 different designs with space for more.
  Use your spinner to choose patterns for future Zentangle® artwork. All t
 ools and materials supplied\, or if you have a favorite pen bring it!
LOCATION:Room C\, Brown County Public Library\, 205 Locust Lane\, Nashvill
 e
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/zentangle-time/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
