BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Art and a Movie Film Series: THE CHRISTOPHERS
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261115T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261115T150000
UID:ca4867e311a87fced4d6df8b625afdec@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Julian Sklar (Ian McKellen) was once a star of London’s 1960
 s and ’70s pop art explosion\, but he hasn’t painted in decades and ha
 s been broke for years. His two estranged children (James Corden\, Jessica
  Gunning)\, desperate for an inheritance\, hire Lori\, an art restorer and
  former forger (Michaela Coel)\, to pose as a prospective assistant in ord
 er to access eight unfinished canvases Julian has buried deep in storage. 
 Her plan is to complete them\, then return them to storage\, where they ar
 e to be “discovered” upon Julian’s death. [100 min\; comedy\, drama
 \; English]
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street \, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/art-and-a-movie-film-series-the-christophers/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
