SUMMARY:Off Night Cabaret: Leading Ladies of Broadway\, presented by: Off 
 Night Productions
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261115T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261115T153000
UID:45326f2e3a12dc1aabc5ebdd62aea59d@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Broadway runs on divas—and we’re here for it! From golden-
 age icons to today’s powerhouse voices\, Leading Ladies of Broadway cele
 brates the women who have defined the stage. Divas\, ingénues\, trailblaz
 ers\, and scene-stealers alike will belt the roof off\, make you laugh\, a
 nd break your heart. This unforgettable evening of music shines a spotligh
 t on not only their songs\, but also the resilience\, glamour\, spirit and
  wide-ranging identities of the women who’ve made Broadway legendary. Ag
 e Recommendation: 13+
LOCATION:Constellation Playhouse\, 107 W 9th St\,  Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/off-night-cabaret-leading-ladies-of-broadway-p
 resented-by-off-night-productions/
