BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The ConstelLate Show: Holiday Special
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T213000
UID:c1d67014d150b228511c97c18df29873@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:The ConstelLate Show is Constellation’s very own late-night 
 holiday special—part talk show\, part variety show\, and completely one-
 of-a-kind. Running throughout the holidays with brand-new guests each nigh
 t\, this festive evening brings together local luminaries\, performers\, a
 nd personalities. Each episode features interviews\, games\, live music\, 
 comedy\, surprise talents\, and a few unexpected twists. Complete with cam
 eras and live monitors\, audiences won’t just watch the show—they’ll
  feel like they’re part of the broadcast. It’s joyful\, it’s unpredi
 ctable\, and it’s the most Constellation way imaginable to celebrate the
  season. See Constellation’s website for more information\, including a 
 detailed performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at https://seec
 onstellation.org/ event/constellate-show/
LOCATION:Rose Firebay\, Waldron Arts Center\, 122 S Walnut St (use the 4th
  St. entrance)\, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/the-constellate-show-holiday-special/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
