DESCRIPTION:Presented by Constellation Stage & Screen This Tony-nominated 
 adaptation of Henrik Ibsen’s masterpiece follows a small-town doctor who
  discovers a catastrophe that risks the lives of everyone in town. After r
 aising the alarm\, he is shaken to his core as those in power\, including 
 his own brother\, not only try to silence him—they try to destroy him. S
 ee Constellation’s website for more information\, including a detailed p
 erformance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconstellati
 on.org/ mainstage/enemy-of-the-people/
